column1:
{酒馆房间ID}（必填），以下三个参数都可以单独填写，空下不填就不会影响房间已有数据。
{总热度}
{房间内时间段热度增长值}
{酒馆内人数，方便以后idip指令直接扩充}

column2:
{Tavern Room ID} (required). The three parameters below can each be filled in separately; leaving one empty will not affect the room's existing data.
{Total Popularity}
{Popularity growth per time period in the room}
{Number of people in the tavern, for future direct expansion via IDIP commands}

column1:
{酒館房間ID}（必填），以下三個參數都可以單獨填寫，空下不填就不會影響房間已有數據。
{總熱度}
{房間內時間段熱度增長值}
{酒館內人數，方便以後idip指令直接擴充}

column2:
{Tavern Room ID} (required). Each of the three parameters below can be filled in individually; leaving one blank will not affect the room's existing data.
{Total Popularity}
{Popularity gain per time period in the room}
{Number of people in the Tavern, for future direct expansion via IDIP commands}
